# Mailcraft — Cursor Rules

The full AI rules for this project are in CLAUDE.md. Read that file for all email HTML rules, template structure, and coding patterns.

Key points:
- HTML emails use <table> layout, not <div> — no flexbox, no grid, no modern CSS
- All styles must be inline (style="...")
- Templates use Jinja2 and extend base.html
- Each template lives in templates/<name>/ with email.html and data.json
- Max email width: 600px
- No JavaScript, no SVG, no <form>, no CSS animations
- Use padding for spacing, never margin
- Set font-family on every text element
